{"synopsis":"\\[Dari studio yang mengerjakan \\<The Novel’s Extra (Remake)>!]\n\nLee Saehoon, blacksmith dari pasukan terakhir umat manusia yang penuh keputusasaan, bertarung melawan para iblis hingga detik terakhir.&#x20;\n\nNamun, hasilnya adalah kehancuran bersama, dan dunia pun berakhir. Pada saat ia mengakhiri hidupnya karena kesimpulan yang sia-sia itu...\n\n“…Apa ini?”\n\nIa telah kembali ke masa ketika dirinya masih menjadi kandidat di institusi pelatihan pahlawan, Akademi Babel. Setelah memperoleh kesempatan kedua, dia bersumpah akan menggunakan apa pun sebagai alat untuk meraih kemenangan kali ini. Apa pun!","alternative_title":"회귀자가 다 만들어줌","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"24375505-c6ec-4da9-90b1-20c17a737ebe","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"a157ac36-9790-4769-afea-2f7d8e40ce6a","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-07-25"},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"fadf94d8-ad78-438b-b9f8-c991d60ee226","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-07-11"},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"43c39019-71de-4406-bb26-f3e0eb5e5a86","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-07-04"},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"936317e0-ecee-495f-ae8c-be86b918d0ba","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2026-06-20"},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"fd19f0cb-ab14-4aa7-ac07-0560cfb869a6","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-06-06"},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"082f0c9a-5ab1-4570-b455-2b7fe1a6eb77","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-05-30"},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"1db9ee97-ffd3-4db9-a24b-c328f47b00fc","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-05-16"},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"c86cb09d-c18e-4cd8-a236-7ccea4ab1cd1","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-05-02"},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"88dcfd5d-800c-4ed0-8538-1ae4cd868114","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-04-25"},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"ca5c4cca-2436-4d60-9b4e-b45261c3febb","title":"Chapter 25","date":"202